# The author's two spellings of the call (2026-10-06, LMX_blog/2026-10-06.md#explicit-call-frame): `r: twice: 3` and
# `s: twice(3)` both call twice with 3 and give 6.  `r: twice 3` is no call (unit_value_tail_prefix_call_refused).
# Entry 7.
fn: twice (int: n) int
    return: n * 2
end: twice
int: r 0
int: s 0
r: twice: 3
s: twice(3)
sendMessage: exit(exit_code: r + s - 5; stdout: ""; stderr: "")
return
